, drivers and project teams use to get their work done.",{"children":"I am a senior product designer. For more than ten years I have designed mobile apps, SaaS products, dashboards and admin tools — screens that dispatchers, drivers and project teams use to get their work done."}],["$","p","Since 2020 I have worked on one ride-hailing and logistics ecosystem: passenger apps, driver apps, dispatcher CRM, reporting dashboards and admin workflows. Before that I designed healthcare applications and, as a freelancer, project management and team collaboration tools. I start with the flows and the information architecture, together with the developers, and only then draw the high-fidelity UI.",{"children":"Since 2020 I have worked on one ride-hailing and logistics ecosystem: passenger apps, driver apps, dispatcher CRM, reporting dashboards and admin workflows. Before that I designed healthcare applications and, as a freelancer, project management and team collaboration tools. I start with the flows and the information architecture, together with the developers, and only then draw the high-fidelity UI."}],["$","p","I also use OpenAI Codex and Claude Code to take designs into code: landing pages, product-site prototypes and admin concepts. I review the HTML, CSS and JavaScript they produce and write instructions developers can build from.",{"children":"I also use OpenAI Codex and Claude Code to take designs into code: landing pages, product-site prototypes and admin concepts. I review the HTML, CSS and JavaScript they produce and write instructions developers can build from."}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"profile-intro__aside","children":[["$","dl",null,{"className":"meta-row profile-intro__facts","children":[["$","div","Based in",{"children":[["$","dt",null,{"children":"Based in"}],["$","dd",null,{"children":"Kyiv, Ukraine"}]]}]]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"profile-intro__action","children":["$","a",null,{"className":"button-link button-link--primary","download":true